    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cEvery guest who checked in\u2026 was never seen again.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > stumble across a half-abandoned motel deep in the woods. It looks lived-in. Warm lights glow in the hallways. There\u2019s luggage left behind. But no one answers the bell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Echoveil: The Last Guest</strong>, you play as a lone Journalist seeking shelter \u2014only to uncover a chilling secret hiding behind every door. The motel seems to breathe. Rooms shift. Shadows move where they shouldn\u2019t. And something\u2026 or someone\u2026 is watching you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d Explore. Listen. Escape.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f <strong>Explore the motel</strong> and uncover its past through forgotten journals, eerie sounds, and the belongings of guests who vanished.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude9e <strong>Experience psychological horror</strong> without cheap jumpscares\u2014only subtle tension, shifting spaces, and things that shouldn\u2019t exist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0<strong> Find clues</strong> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Designed for:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of <strong>narrative horror</strong> and <strong>walking sims</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy <strong>atmospheric, emotional mysteries</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short-form story experiences (20\u201330 minutes)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you escape the motel... or become its last guest?</strong></p>",
